ractions.|[T0]|related files:[main.py, templates/forum.html]', 'T6': '|Manage data storage.|Implement file handling for users.txt, tips.txt, articles.txt, and forum.txt in main.py to store and retrieve data.|[T1, T4, T5]|related files:[main.py]'}, 'Full API spec': '', 'Shared Knowledge': '`main.py` contains functions shared across the project for user authentication and content management.'}

